  "title": "Best Homemade Chow Chow",
  "description": "Chow chow is a delicious tangy Southern-style relish with green tomatoes, bell peppers, and chiles that&#39;s great to make with late summer vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "SLT"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-25T20:03:32-04:00",
